@base_url = http://localhost:8000
# Keep this in sync with local .env APP_API_KEY.
# This is a demo-only value, not a production secret.
@api_key = change-me-dev-only-random-32-chars

### Health check
GET {{base_url}}/health

### Readiness check
GET {{base_url}}/ready

### Ask with API key
POST {{base_url}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
  "question": "Tóm tắt các điểm cần kiểm tra trước khi deploy AI agent lên cloud"
}

### Unauthorized request should return 401
POST {{base_url}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Request này thiếu API key"
}
